factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 4 problems
  The caption says the 100+ vacant headmaster posts are in 80 schools, which is a mix-up: the article says 80 schools have vacancies, and separately that 100+ posts are vacant across the district; the caption wrongly ties 'இதில் 80 பள்ளிகளில்' to the 100+ figure.
  The reel_script says 'தலைமை ஆசிரியர் இல்லாததால் 10ம் வகுப்பு பொதுத்தேருக்கு' (typo 'தேருக்கு' instead of 'தேர்வுக்கு'), making the phrase ungrammatical/meaningless in Tamil.
  The reel_script says the parents' concern is that 'Erode will fall behind as last year' but the article says the parents said the district is at risk of lagging in pass percentage; minor, but the reel_script attributes the 'கவனக்குறைவு' concern to parents while the article ties it to workload generally.
  The reel_script and caption say the 10th-class pass percentage will lag 'as last year', but the article's claim is a prediction by parents, which the draft presents as a near-certain statement rather than a concern.
